1
00:00:06,680 --> 00:00:09,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Everyone's responsible
for copyright protection.]</font>

2
00:00:09,310 --> 00:00:14,020
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

3
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:18,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

4
00:00:19,730 --> 00:00:25,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

5
00:00:25,380 --> 00:00:30,890
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

6
00:00:31,520 --> 00:00:36,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

7
00:00:37,150 --> 00:00:40,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

8
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:47,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪In this vast world,
I wait for your light♪</font>

9
00:00:47,740 --> 00:00:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream
till dawn is bright♪</font>

10
00:00:53,220 --> 00:00:58,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪All the riddles of parting
I'll uncover♪</font>

11
00:00:58,840 --> 00:01:01,100
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪At last, I'll sing, kiss, and hold you♪</font>

12
00:01:01,100 --> 00:01:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The answer is revealed
within your heart♪</font>

13
00:01:09,720 --> 00:01:12,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[The Legendary Chitose-Sama]</font>

14
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:16,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Episode 43]</font>

15
00:01:17,680 --> 00:01:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao's watching me closely lately.</font>

16
00:01:20,400 --> 00:01:22,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He insists on going everywhere with me.</font>

17
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never knew he was so clingy before.</font>

18
00:01:25,280 --> 00:01:26,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Aren't I the same?</font>

19
00:01:26,880 --> 00:01:28,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I thought I'd found an ideal husband,</font>

20
00:01:28,800 --> 00:01:30,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">but it turns out I got another father.</font>

21
00:01:30,720 --> 00:01:32,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's teaming up with the servants
to spy on me.</font>

22
00:01:33,360 --> 00:01:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">With all the congee and greens lately,</font>

23
00:01:35,440 --> 00:01:36,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">my face is turning green.</font>

24
00:01:40,080 --> 00:01:41,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you sighing?</font>

25
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I sigh for how times</font>

26
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:46,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have changed.</font>

27
00:01:47,000 --> 00:01:48,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I recall the old days,</font>

28
00:01:48,560 --> 00:01:49,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">when the three of us</font>

29
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">dominated the Court of Judicial Review.</font>

30
00:01:52,280 --> 00:01:53,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How carefree and dashing we were.</font>

31
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was only back in Beiyuan
for a few months.</font>

32
00:01:56,360 --> 00:01:57,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How is it that upon my return,</font>

33
00:01:57,680 --> 00:01:58,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">all you can see</font>

34
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is your husbands now?</font>

35
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:02,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Am I not your first priority?</font>

36
00:02:02,680 --> 00:02:03,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If I'd known it would be like this,</font>

37
00:02:03,600 --> 00:02:05,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I never should have come back
to see you.</font>

38
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:07,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief,</font>

39
00:02:07,880 --> 00:02:09,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you mustn't think that way.</font>

40
00:02:10,320 --> 00:02:11,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Though we have our husbands
in our arms,</font>

41
00:02:12,600 --> 00:02:14,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">our bond as brothers remains.</font>

42
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:15,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun is right.</font>

43
00:02:16,240 --> 00:02:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Husbands are nothing.</font>

44
00:02:17,960 --> 00:02:18,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're my brother.</font>

45
00:02:19,280 --> 00:02:20,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We three are on the same side.</font>

46
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:22,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two,</font>

47
00:02:23,160 --> 00:02:24,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">do you really mean that?</font>

48
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:30,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear.</font>

49
00:02:31,480 --> 00:02:32,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sweetie.</font>

50
00:02:34,640 --> 00:02:35,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Staying out in the wind
is bad for the baby.</font>

51
00:02:36,640 --> 00:02:37,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come inside and rest with me.</font>

52
00:02:38,120 --> 00:02:39,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We should go have our meal, too.</font>

53
00:02:40,240 --> 00:02:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's right.</font>

54
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Qinglan.</font>

55
00:02:46,360 --> 00:02:46,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

56
00:02:46,960 --> 00:02:47,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on.</font>

57
00:02:47,520 --> 00:02:47,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go.</font>

58
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:50,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not that delicate.</font>

59
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A perfect pair.</font>

60
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A perfect pair.</font>

61
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:55,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

62
00:03:05,120 --> 00:03:05,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

63
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:06,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

64
00:03:06,920 --> 00:03:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait for me.</font>

65
00:03:08,120 --> 00:03:09,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't finished.</font>

66
00:03:09,280 --> 00:03:10,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You have to hear me out.</font>

67
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go and meet her.</font>

68
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's already waiting.</font>

69
00:03:13,560 --> 00:03:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's truly a refined lady.</font>

70
00:03:17,080 --> 00:03:17,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

71
00:03:18,040 --> 00:03:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What refined lady?</font>

72
00:03:20,440 --> 00:03:20,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief.</font>

73
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:22,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where are you two headed?</font>

74
00:03:23,200 --> 00:03:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun.</font>

75
00:03:24,200 --> 00:03:25,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help me convince him.</font>

76
00:03:26,200 --> 00:03:28,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just a few days ago, he was saying</font>

77
00:03:28,080 --> 00:03:28,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that we were ignoring him.</font>

78
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:29,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You see,</font>

79
00:03:29,840 --> 00:03:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a friend from Yanjing is touring Xizhao.</font>

80
00:03:32,560 --> 00:03:33,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want to introduce them.</font>

81
00:03:34,320 --> 00:03:36,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's been waiting in the hall for ages.</font>

82
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:37,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But Jiang Yufan refuses to go.</font>

83
00:03:38,280 --> 00:03:40,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where am I supposed</font>

84
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to show my face?</font>

85
00:03:42,480 --> 00:03:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Chief, are you going on a blind date?</font>

86
00:03:45,520 --> 00:03:47,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, you're truly devoted</font>

87
00:03:47,640 --> 00:03:48,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">to blind dates.</font>

88
00:03:49,360 --> 00:03:50,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Same old routine.</font>

89
00:03:50,760 --> 00:03:51,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm not going.</font>

90
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:52,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Whoever wants to go can go.</font>

91
00:03:54,320 --> 00:03:55,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Yufan.</font>

92
00:03:56,120 --> 00:03:58,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Father saw me yesterday,</font>

93
00:03:58,200 --> 00:03:59,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">he was subtly asking</font>

94
00:03:59,960 --> 00:04:01,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if you really fancy men.</font>

95
00:04:02,880 --> 00:04:04,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tell me the truth.</font>

96
00:04:04,440 --> 00:04:06,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you do like men, it's fine.</font>

97
00:04:06,600 --> 00:04:07,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can introduce you to some men.</font>

98
00:04:08,120 --> 00:04:08,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's no shame in it.</font>

99
00:04:08,880 --> 00:04:09,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

100
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:12,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have you not yet emptied
your brain of filth?</font>

101
00:04:12,360 --> 00:04:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When Father misunderstood me,</font>

102
00:04:13,280 --> 00:04:14,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you saw it all clearly, didn't you?</font>

103
00:04:14,760 --> 00:04:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Isn't it because...</font>

104
00:04:15,920 --> 00:04:17,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Jiang, don't tell me</font>

105
00:04:17,320 --> 00:04:18,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you still harbor</font>

106
00:04:18,280 --> 00:04:19,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">other feelings for my wife?</font>

107
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">As if everyone thinks like you.</font>

108
00:04:22,520 --> 00:04:23,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just look at yourself right now.</font>

109
00:04:24,040 --> 00:04:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're nothing but a wife's slave.</font>

110
00:04:27,240 --> 00:04:28,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Have it your way, Jiang Yufan.</font>

111
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:29,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go or don't. I don't care.</font>

112
00:04:30,080 --> 00:04:31,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look at yourself.</font>

113
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No wonder I have no sister-in-law.</font>

114
00:04:34,200 --> 00:04:35,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My friend</font>

115
00:04:35,800 --> 00:04:36,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">is</font>

116
00:04:37,720 --> 00:04:39,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a heavenly beauty,</font>

117
00:04:39,880 --> 00:04:41,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">delicate and endearing,</font>

118
00:04:42,120 --> 00:04:43,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and of noble birth.</font>

119
00:04:44,400 --> 00:04:45,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If she ends up with you,</font>

120
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:48,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">it would be a bit of a waste.</font>

121
00:04:48,960 --> 00:04:49,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What a waste.</font>

122
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Since Ying has already invited her,</font>

123
00:04:52,640 --> 00:04:54,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and she's from Beiyuan,</font>

124
00:04:54,640 --> 00:04:56,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">there's no harm in making a friend.</font>

125
00:04:57,640 --> 00:04:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How about</font>

126
00:04:59,480 --> 00:05:00,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">we go with you?</font>

127
00:05:03,960 --> 00:05:05,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then I'll graciously</font>

128
00:05:05,480 --> 00:05:06,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">lower myself</font>

129
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">and go meet her.</font>

130
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:10,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's hurry.</font>

131
00:05:10,560 --> 00:05:11,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't waste my wife's time.</font>

132
00:05:12,640 --> 00:05:12,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You...</font>

133
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:13,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just go, will you?</font>

134
00:05:13,960 --> 00:05:14,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You can stay.</font>

135
00:05:14,880 --> 00:05:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop dawdling.</font>

136
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:16,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Easy there.</font>

137
00:05:16,240 --> 00:05:16,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, go.</font>

138
00:05:16,720 --> 00:05:17,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's fine.</font>

139
00:05:19,120 --> 00:05:19,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhu!</font>

140
00:05:20,160 --> 00:05:20,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhu!</font>

141
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The great hero I told you about is here.</font>

142
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhu.</font>

143
00:05:26,680 --> 00:05:27,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That's the guy?</font>

144
00:05:27,280 --> 00:05:27,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jiang Ying.</font>

145
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:28,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You call her</font>

146
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">a heavenly beauty and refined lady?</font>

147
00:05:32,560 --> 00:05:33,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">He's the chivalrous hero</font>

148
00:05:33,520 --> 00:05:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that you talked about?</font>

149
00:05:36,480 --> 00:05:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Zhu is General Chen's granddaughter.</font>

150
00:05:38,760 --> 00:05:39,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, she's a refined lady.</font>

151
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:40,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My brother</font>

152
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:43,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">helped keep peace at the border.</font>

153
00:05:43,840 --> 00:05:44,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Of course, he's a hero.</font>

154
00:05:47,080 --> 00:05:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You two know each other?</font>

155
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:49,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who'd know her?</font>

156
00:05:49,760 --> 00:05:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">A heavenly beauty? Don't make me laugh.</font>

157
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:55,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Escorting a bride counts
as border service?</font>

158
00:05:55,080 --> 00:05:56,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you looking down on?</font>

159
00:05:56,400 --> 00:05:57,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let me tell you something.</font>

160
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You scratched me when we were kids.</font>

161
00:05:58,320 --> 00:05:59,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't settled
the score with you yet.</font>

162
00:06:00,080 --> 00:06:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">But I</font>

163
00:06:01,600 --> 00:06:03,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">never hit a woman.</font>

164
00:06:03,840 --> 00:06:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomboys don't count.</font>

165
00:06:07,000 --> 00:06:07,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Say that again.</font>

166
00:06:09,400 --> 00:06:11,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tomboys don't count.</font>

167
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

168
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:19,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

169
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:20,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Will you let go?</font>

170
00:06:20,400 --> 00:06:20,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

171
00:06:21,160 --> 00:06:21,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm warning you.</font>

172
00:06:21,920 --> 00:06:23,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I have 300 men.</font>

173
00:06:23,240 --> 00:06:24,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they find out,
they'll beat you to death.</font>

174
00:06:25,200 --> 00:06:25,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

175
00:06:25,880 --> 00:06:27,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let them come and beat me to death.</font>

176
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Just beat me to death if you can.</font>

177
00:06:28,920 --> 00:06:29,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ow!</font>

178
00:06:29,880 --> 00:06:30,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouch!</font>

179
00:06:31,120 --> 00:06:31,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ouch!</font>

180
00:06:31,560 --> 00:06:31,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying.</font>

181
00:06:32,320 --> 00:06:34,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why don't you go talk to your friend?</font>

182
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:35,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No. I'm not going.</font>

183
00:06:35,800 --> 00:06:36,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't beat her.</font>

184
00:06:37,880 --> 00:06:39,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When a woman loses her temper,</font>

185
00:06:39,760 --> 00:06:40,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">you really can't mess with her.</font>

186
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Stop just watching the show.</font>

187
00:06:43,360 --> 00:06:45,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If they fight,
your child could get hurt.</font>

188
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:45,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go.</font>

189
00:06:46,720 --> 00:06:47,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you letting go?</font>

190
00:06:47,440 --> 00:06:47,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

191
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're pretty strong!</font>

192
00:06:50,000 --> 00:06:51,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you even act like a lady?</font>

193
00:06:51,680 --> 00:06:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go of me.</font>

194
00:06:52,320 --> 00:06:52,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let go.</font>

195
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare, fight me one-on-one.</font>

196
00:06:53,320 --> 00:06:54,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why are you so annoying?</font>

197
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:56,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear,</font>

198
00:06:57,440 --> 00:06:58,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">was my performance satisfactory?</font>

199
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where is Wei?</font>

200
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:04,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't know.</font>

201
00:07:29,520 --> 00:07:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on.</font>

202
00:07:31,960 --> 00:07:33,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Who are you?</font>

203
00:07:33,640 --> 00:07:34,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I am a coroner.</font>

204
00:07:34,960 --> 00:07:36,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Wang, I heard you've recently run</font>

205
00:07:36,400 --> 00:07:37,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">into some trouble.</font>

206
00:07:37,680 --> 00:07:38,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I came to offer my assistance.</font>

207
00:07:39,400 --> 00:07:41,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You are a coroner?</font>

208
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">When a person was alive,</font>

209
00:07:48,640 --> 00:07:50,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">if a bone was fractured and bled,</font>

210
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">sunlight through a red parasol</font>

211
00:07:52,920 --> 00:07:54,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can reveal the blood</font>

212
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:55,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">upon the broken bone.</font>

213
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Look here.</font>

214
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Her right leg bone</font>

215
00:08:00,640 --> 00:08:02,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">shows a fracture.</font>

216
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There is redness at the break.</font>

217
00:08:04,160 --> 00:08:06,160
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">This means it was broken before death.</font>

218
00:08:07,360 --> 00:08:08,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So,</font>

219
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:10,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your daughter
may not have died of illness.</font>

220
00:08:11,640 --> 00:08:12,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She was likely murdered.</font>

221
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:16,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My daughter.</font>

222
00:08:16,840 --> 00:08:19,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You died so unjustly.</font>

223
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jun Qinglan.</font>

224
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:26,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Why can't you behave
and stop running off?</font>

225
00:08:33,400 --> 00:08:34,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come home with me right now.</font>

226
00:08:36,200 --> 00:08:37,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My daughter.</font>

227
00:08:37,960 --> 00:08:40,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You died so unjustly.</font>

228
00:08:50,240 --> 00:08:51,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">That fool Jiang Ying.</font>

229
00:08:52,360 --> 00:08:53,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She's set me up again.</font>

230
00:08:59,240 --> 00:09:00,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Do you see that table?</font>

231
00:09:00,560 --> 00:09:01,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">There's a knife on it.</font>

232
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's jump over and cut the ropes.</font>

233
00:09:03,160 --> 00:09:04,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Then let's fight for real,
no holding back.</font>

234
00:09:05,920 --> 00:09:06,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fine.</font>

235
00:09:06,880 --> 00:09:07,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's get the knife.</font>

236
00:09:10,520 --> 00:09:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wait.</font>

237
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:13,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">On three, we jump together.</font>

238
00:09:13,520 --> 00:09:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ready?</font>

239
00:09:15,040 --> 00:09:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jump.</font>

240
00:09:18,480 --> 00:09:18,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jump.</font>

241
00:09:21,080 --> 00:09:21,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Jump.</font>

242
00:09:56,040 --> 00:09:57,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How did I fall for her?</font>

243
00:10:09,080 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

244
00:10:10,480 --> 00:10:11,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't be angry.</font>

245
00:10:12,440 --> 00:10:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I haven't done an autopsy in so long.</font>

246
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:15,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My hands were itching for it.</font>

247
00:10:16,480 --> 00:10:18,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It won't happen again.</font>

248
00:10:18,960 --> 00:10:19,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I swear.</font>

249
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear.</font>

250
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm truly not angry.</font>

251
00:10:27,840 --> 00:10:29,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You just called me Jun Qinglan.</font>

252
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">And you say you're not mad.</font>

253
00:10:33,680 --> 00:10:34,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I was just thinking</font>

254
00:10:35,920 --> 00:10:37,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">that whether you are Qin Wei</font>

255
00:10:37,640 --> 00:10:38,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">or Jun Qinglan,</font>

256
00:10:40,160 --> 00:10:41,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">no matter when I met you,</font>

257
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I would have surely fallen for you.</font>

258
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:52,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">We've been a couple for so long.</font>

259
00:10:52,440 --> 00:10:53,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No need for such words.</font>

260
00:10:56,400 --> 00:10:58,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, if this happens again next time,</font>

261
00:10:59,240 --> 00:11:01,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">can you come with me?</font>

262
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:01,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No.</font>

263
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">However,</font>

264
00:11:05,000 --> 00:11:05,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I could always</font>

265
00:11:05,640 --> 00:11:07,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">have some bodies brought here</font>

266
00:11:07,480 --> 00:11:08,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">for you to practice on.</font>

267
00:11:09,440 --> 00:11:10,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What fun is that?</font>

268
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:12,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">To be honest,</font>

269
00:11:13,680 --> 00:11:15,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I quite like watching you
examine corpses.</font>

270
00:11:18,120 --> 00:11:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">You're twisted.</font>

271
00:11:19,440 --> 00:11:19,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's go back inside.</font>

272
00:11:23,840 --> 00:11:24,840
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tuan,</font>

273
00:11:25,520 --> 00:11:27,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">your father is so twisted.</font>

274
00:11:27,960 --> 00:11:29,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">So, what would you like for dinner?</font>

275
00:11:30,480 --> 00:11:31,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Nothing at all.</font>

276
00:11:31,760 --> 00:11:32,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Are you sure?</font>

277
00:11:32,880 --> 00:11:33,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I want something sour.</font>

278
00:11:34,120 --> 00:11:34,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Sour?</font>

279
00:11:37,680 --> 00:11:38,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Dear, have some tea.</font>

280
00:11:46,720 --> 00:11:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Honey.</font>

281
00:11:47,960 --> 00:11:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How much longer till Mother gets here?</font>

282
00:11:49,640 --> 00:11:50,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Probably two or three days.</font>

283
00:11:50,960 --> 00:11:51,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She'll be here in time.</font>

284
00:11:51,680 --> 00:11:52,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Don't worry.</font>

285
00:11:53,280 --> 00:11:55,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tuan's been kicking my belly
a lot lately.</font>

286
00:11:56,480 --> 00:11:57,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I think</font>

287
00:11:57,680 --> 00:11:59,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">they just can't wait to come out.</font>

288
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:04,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Now, listen here.</font>

289
00:12:05,640 --> 00:12:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you dare come out too early,</font>

290
00:12:07,680 --> 00:12:08,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will spank you.</font>

291
00:12:13,840 --> 00:12:14,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What's wrong?</font>

292
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:15,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Where does it hurt?</font>

293
00:12:16,480 --> 00:12:17,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao,</font>

294
00:12:17,560 --> 00:12:19,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">who told you to threaten them?</font>

295
00:12:21,280 --> 00:12:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What are you standing there for?</font>

296
00:12:22,800 --> 00:12:24,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go fetch the midwife!</font>

297
00:12:24,040 --> 00:12:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Right away!</font>

298
00:12:26,960 --> 00:12:28,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hurry!</font>

299
00:12:28,520 --> 00:12:29,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Someone!</font>

300
00:12:29,280 --> 00:12:30,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Help!</font>

301
00:12:30,240 --> 00:12:31,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Fetch the midwife, quickly.</font>

302
00:12:31,200 --> 00:12:32,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei is in labor.</font>

303
00:12:34,200 --> 00:12:35,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Easy now, easy.</font>

304
00:12:35,680 --> 00:12:36,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Go, go.</font>

305
00:12:38,320 --> 00:12:38,920
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Watch your step.</font>

306
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">My Lady, take a deep breath.</font>

307
00:12:42,480 --> 00:12:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Push a little harder.</font>

308
00:12:43,720 --> 00:12:44,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep going.</font>

309
00:12:44,880 --> 00:12:46,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes, just like that.</font>

310
00:12:48,200 --> 00:12:48,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Push.</font>

311
00:12:50,760 --> 00:12:52,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Is childbirth always this terrifying?</font>

312
00:12:54,680 --> 00:12:56,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao!</font>

313
00:12:57,720 --> 00:12:58,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

314
00:12:58,800 --> 00:13:00,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li, you mustn't enter.</font>

315
00:13:00,400 --> 00:13:01,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I'm right here. Don't be afraid.</font>

316
00:13:01,680 --> 00:13:02,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What bad luck is there to speak of?</font>

317
00:13:02,560 --> 00:13:03,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">She is my wife.</font>

318
00:13:04,640 --> 00:13:05,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">How are you feeling now?</font>

319
00:13:06,440 --> 00:13:07,120
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It hurts a lot, doesn't it?</font>

320
00:13:07,640 --> 00:13:08,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Obviously.</font>

321
00:13:11,160 --> 00:13:12,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Come on, breathe with me.</font>

322
00:13:12,880 --> 00:13:13,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inhale.</font>

323
00:13:14,800 --> 00:13:15,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exhale.</font>

324
00:13:16,360 --> 00:13:17,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Inhale.</font>

325
00:13:18,000 --> 00:13:18,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Exhale.</font>

326
00:13:20,840 --> 00:13:21,640
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Does it still hurt a lot?</font>

327
00:13:22,880 --> 00:13:24,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It's no use at all.</font>

328
00:13:24,400 --> 00:13:25,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">What do we do then?</font>

329
00:13:28,280 --> 00:13:29,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Li Congyao.</font>

330
00:13:29,640 --> 00:13:31,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I regret this.</font>

331
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Regret what?</font>

332
00:13:34,240 --> 00:13:36,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I don't want to have your child anymore.</font>

333
00:13:37,840 --> 00:13:38,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">It hurts too much.</font>

334
00:13:38,800 --> 00:13:41,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can't do this.</font>

335
00:13:41,720 --> 00:13:42,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

336
00:13:42,680 --> 00:13:43,240
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Hold on a little longer.</font>

337
00:13:43,840 --> 00:13:44,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Here, bite my hand.</font>

338
00:13:45,040 --> 00:13:45,560
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The baby's almost here.</font>

339
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:47,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Push harder.</font>

340
00:13:48,120 --> 00:13:49,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, yes, that's it.</font>

341
00:13:49,640 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I can see the head.</font>

342
00:13:51,160 --> 00:13:53,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Almost there. Push harder!</font>

343
00:13:53,760 --> 00:13:55,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Push!</font>

344
00:13:56,240 --> 00:13:57,000
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Yes, that's it.</font>

345
00:13:58,280 --> 00:13:59,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Keep pushing.</font>

346
00:14:00,240 --> 00:14:01,320
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Congratulations, Mr. Li.</font>

347
00:14:02,160 --> 00:14:03,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">The child is born.</font>

348
00:14:03,400 --> 00:14:04,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Finally, it's here.</font>

349
00:14:05,440 --> 00:14:06,040
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Your Highness.</font>

350
00:14:10,040 --> 00:14:10,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Ying, what's wrong?</font>

351
00:14:13,120 --> 00:14:14,200
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I feel a bit nauseous.</font>

352
00:14:15,680 --> 00:14:16,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Could it be...?</font>

353
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Bad news!</font>

354
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:20,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mr. Li fainted from the stress!</font>

355
00:14:40,160 --> 00:14:45,400
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">[Three years later]</font>

356
00:14:47,300 --> 00:14:52,080
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪After all the joy and sorrow♪</font>

357
00:14:52,620 --> 00:14:56,480
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I still recall your face♪</font>

358
00:14:57,670 --> 00:15:03,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪You were by my side;
the cool rain fell♪</font>

359
00:15:03,310 --> 00:15:08,870
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I closed my eyes
and heard you sing gently♪</font>

360
00:15:09,350 --> 00:15:14,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I'd wager all
for a love that never ends♪</font>

361
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:15,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Wei.</font>

362
00:15:15,550 --> 00:15:18,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪To keep you forever near♪</font>

363
00:15:21,320 --> 00:15:22,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">No kissing.</font>

364
00:15:22,940 --> 00:15:25,720
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I wait for your light♪</font>

365
00:15:25,750 --> 00:15:28,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll share this dream♪</font>

366
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:29,760
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Tuan.</font>

367
00:15:30,880 --> 00:15:31,280
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Give me a hug.</font>

368
00:15:31,320 --> 00:15:34,990
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪I often think of those
we parted ways with♪</font>

369
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:35,600
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">If you keep making noise,</font>

370
00:15:35,880 --> 00:15:36,800
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">I will send you away.</font>

371
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:40,680
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Mother, Father wants to send me away!</font>

372
00:15:41,640 --> 00:15:42,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">Let's ignore him.</font>

373
00:15:42,510 --> 00:15:47,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪The gentle scent is you
and the flowers♪</font>

374
00:15:48,050 --> 00:15:51,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Singing, kissing, and embracing,
we're finally at peace♪</font>

375
00:15:53,100 --> 00:15:54,960
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We'll see all the world's sights♪</font>

376
00:15:55,970 --> 00:15:57,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Drifting with the clouds♪</font>

377
00:15:57,640 --> 00:16:00,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Leave our names etched
in each other's hearts♪</font>

378
00:16:01,560 --> 00:16:05,880
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Bright as a goddess, stirring my soul♪</font>

379
00:16:06,240 --> 00:16:09,540
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Each stroke inscribed
into the passing years♪</font>

380
00:16:10,220 --> 00:16:14,360
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪A sky full of stars covers
the peach blossom spring♪</font>

381
00:16:14,750 --> 00:16:19,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪With you, hand in hand
across the vast world♪</font>

382
00:16:19,080 --> 00:16:24,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No words needed,
our hearts mirror each other♪</font>

383
00:16:27,210 --> 00:16:31,520
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Catching a teardrop on my fingertip♪</font>

384
00:16:31,890 --> 00:16:35,440
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Then gently caressing your face♪</font>

385
00:16:35,930 --> 00:16:40,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪We await mercy
as the rain flutters down♪</font>

386
00:16:40,480 --> 00:16:43,470
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪This floating life
is like a myriad of dreams♪</font>

387
00:16:44,460 --> 00:16:48,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪No matter how far the journey,
our passion endures♪</font>

388
00:16:49,060 --> 00:16:52,830
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular" size="22">♪Let's turn a blind eye
to all the gossip and rumors♪</font>
